ade"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/lithuanian-crusade.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Lithuanian Crusade</span><span class="enc-type">War · 1283–1422</span><span class="enc-snip">The Lithuanian Crusade was the series of campaigns by the Teutonic Order and the Livonian Order against the pagan Grand Duchy of Lithuania from the late thirteenth…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/war-of-the-limburg-succession"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/war-of-the-limburg-succession.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">War of the Limburg Succession</span><span class="enc-type">War · 1283–1289</span><span class="enc-snip">The War of the Limburg Succession was fought from 1283 to 1289 over the Duchy of Limburg after the death of Duchess Ermengard in 1283.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/aragonese-crusade"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/aragonese-crusade.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Aragonese Crusade</span><span class="enc-type">War · 1284–1285</span><span class="enc-snip">The Aragonese Crusade was a crusade declared by Pope Martin IV against King Peter III of Aragon, who had taken Sicily after the Sicilian Vespers.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/mongol-invasion-of-java"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/mongol-invasion-of-java.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Mongol invasion of Java</span><span class="enc-type">Campaign · 1292–1293</span><span class="enc-snip">The Mongol invasion of Java was a naval expedition sent by Kublai Khan of the Yuan Dynasty in 1292 to 1293.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/dudenevs-raid"><span class="enc-name">Dudenev's raid</span><span class="enc-type">Campaign · 1293</span><sp